Archie: Lucide icons.

Adds Lucide (https://lucide.dev, ISC license) icons to
components/vector_icons as vector_icons::kLucide*Icon, and uses the Lucide
"x" for tab close buttons. The .icon files are generated from the SVGs in
Archie's icons/lucide/ by scripts/lucide_to_icon.py; regenerate them
there rather than editing them here.

